---
/**
 * Hook — the lesson's opening scene (AUTHORING.md §1).
 *
 * No equations here: a concrete situation or a naive question that makes the
 * need for the concept visible. The first paragraph reads a touch larger than
 * body copy; everything else is ordinary prose.
 */
---

<div class="hook"><slot /></div>

<style>
  .hook {
    margin: var(--sp-5) 0 var(--sp-6);
  }
  .hook > :global(p:first-child) {
    font-size: 1.06em;
  }
  .hook > :global(:last-child) {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
</style>
